ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡He hecho una {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}cápsula del tiempo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}! {{TAG:0000:0004:}}Aunque tengo que reconocer que{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}lo que contiene es un muermo.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oye, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}ya que estás aquí y eso,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡a lo mejor podrías enrollarte y
enterrarla tú por mí!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
¡Venga, lo haré!
¡Ni hablar!

EN:
This is kind of sudden,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}} but do you
know about {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}time capsules{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I can send workout plans, advice, 
and other important stuff {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}to my
future self!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}You just write it down and bury it,
and then your future self gets all
that great stuff!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Go bury my time capsule for me!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
OK!
No!

It should stay safely tucked away
with your letters until you're ready
to bury it!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
And don't go losing it, got it?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Also, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}the stuff inside the capsule is
totally top secret!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} It's for my eyes
only, understand?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}I'm counting on you!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

IT:
Conservala in un posto sicuro,
fino a che non la sotterri!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
E non la perdere, OK?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}E poi, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}quello che c'è
nella capsula è top secret!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Nessuno deve vederlo, capito?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Conto su di te!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Zaman kapsülümü gömmeyi
tamamen unuttun, değil mi?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
Neyse. Gidip kendim gömerim.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Geri ver o zaman!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bueno, supongo que es algo íntimo
que no se puede compartir, como
la novia y el pañuelo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}In fondo credo che questo sia
proprio il genere di cose che
conviene sotterrarsi da soli.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ah ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Ha ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Want an old, sweat-soaked
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} of mine?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Wow, this brings back memories!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Is there a letter in it too?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Gracias, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Te voy a enviar a casa una
carta y una recompensa!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Grazie, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ti spedirò una lettera e un regalo!
Fammi prima finire i miei esercizi.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Danke, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich schick dir dann 'nen Brief
mit 'nem kleinen Dankeschön!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Quasi dimenticavo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ti sei dat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
da fare per me, quindi devo darti
qualcosa in cambio!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Magari quello che c'era dentro.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mi sembra una buona soluzione!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Fast hätt ich's vergessen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Für deine Mühen muss ich mich
natürlich noch bei dir bedanken!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Weißt du, was?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Ich geb dir den Kapselkram!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Danke, dass du mir geholfen hast!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Du hast dir eine kleine Belohnung
verdient!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bunu benim için hallettiğin
için sağ ol!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ödülü hak ettin!

ES:
¡Es {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0100}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Tenemos que enterrar otra cápsula
algún día de estos!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Cómo mola!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Was zur Hantel?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Du hast die Zeitkapsel geöffnet!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Spiel nicht mit der Zeit herum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Zeitspiel kann fies in die Hose gehn!

{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Wenn du so 'ne Nummer noch
mal abziehst, werd ich wirklich
stinksauer, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
